est-header overrides for relays/WAFs that reject the OpenAI SDK headers.\n- `run_agent.py:4465-4514` applies those headers after provider defaults and reapplies them during client rebuilds/credential swaps.\n- `agent/agent_init.py:1117-1125` and `hermes_cli/config.py:5077-5097` support scoped `extra_headers` on named/custom providers.\n- `cli-config.yaml.example:75-106` documents the `User-Agent` and custom-provider header configuration, and `website/docs/integrations/providers.md:41` documents direct DeepSeek setup via `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`.\n\nThe original report does not include enough endpoint or response detail to attribute its specific 403 further, but the identified missing configuration mechanism and the requested direct-DeepSeek troubleshooting path are now present.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4955917872/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]